{"arm": "direct", "model": "openai/gpt-6-luna", "i": 8, "finish": "stop", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#f7f6ef\">\n  <title>Tidepool \u2014 Make room for a good week</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      color-scheme: light;\n      --ink: #123b3a;\n      --muted: #667775;\n      --paper: #f7f6ef;\n      --white: #fffefa;\n      --line: #e5e6dc;\n      --teal: #1d6560;\n      --mint: #dceee3;\n      --lime: #d5ef85;\n      --coral: #f2a18a;\n      --lavender: #e6e0f3;\n      --shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(22, 57, 53, .13);\n    }\n\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: var(--paper);\n      color: var(--ink);\n      font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    }\n\n    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }\n\n    .wrap {\n      width: min(1160px, calc(100% - 48px));\n      margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n\n    .nav {\n      height: 84px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n    }\n\n    .brand {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n      font-size: 21px;\n      font-weight: 750;\n      letter-spacing: -.7px;\n    }\n\n    .brand-mark {\n      width: 34px;\n      height: 34px;\n      display: grid;\n      place-items: center;\n      border-radius: 11px;\n      background: var(--teal);\n      color: var(--lime);\n    }\n\n    .brand-mark svg { width: 21px; height: 21px; }\n\n    .nav-links {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 34px;\n      color: #526764;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-weight: 550;\n    }\n\n    .nav-links a:hover, .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--teal); }\n\n    .nav-cta {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 9px;\n      padding: 11px 17px;\n      border: 1px solid #d8ddd2;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: rgba(255, 254, 250, .7);\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      transition: transform .2s, background .2s;\n    }\n\n    .nav-cta:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); background: white; }\n\n    .hero {\n      min-height: 628px;\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: .91fr 1.09fr;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 42px;\n      padding: 48px 0 82px;\n    }\n\n    .hero-copy { padding: 0 0 12px 2px; }\n\n    .eyebrow {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      margin-bottom: 22px;\n      color: var(--teal);\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .eyebrow-dot {\n      width: 8px;\n      height: 8px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #8ebc73;\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #e6efdb;\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      max-width: 510px;\n      margin: 0;\n      font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n      font-size: clamp(50px, 6vw, 74px);\n      font-weight: 500;\n      letter-spacing: -3.8px;\n      line-height: .99;\n    }\n\n    h1 em {\n      color: var(--teal);\n      font-weight: 500;\n    }\n\n    .hero-copy > p {\n      max-width: 430px;\n      margin: 25px 0 29px;\n      color: #61716f;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n    }\n\n    .hero-actions {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .button {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n      min-height: 51px;\n      padding: 0 21px;\n      border: 0;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: var(--teal);\n      color: white;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-weight: 750;\n      box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(29, 101, 96, .18);\n      transition: transform .2s, box-shadow .2s, background .2s;\n    }\n\n    .button:hover {\n      transform: translateY(-2px);\n      background: #164f4b;\n      box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(29, 101, 96, .22);\n    }\n\n    .button svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; }\n\n    .micro-proof {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n      color: #71807d;\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .avatars { display: flex; padding-left: 3px; }\n    .avatar {\n      width: 25px;\n      height: 25px;\n      margin-left: -4px;\n      display: grid;\n      place-items: center;\n      border: 2px solid var(--paper);\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      color: #264c48;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n    }\n    .avatar:nth-child(1) { background: #f2b69a; }\n    .avatar:nth-child(2) { background: #d5e5a7; }\n    .avatar:nth-child(3) { background: #c6d7ed; }\n    .avatar:nth-child(4) { background: #e9c9d9; }\n\n    .hero-art {\n      position: relative;\n      min-width: 0;\n      padding: 20px 0 22px 14px;\n    }\n\n    .art-glow {\n      position: absolute;\n      inset: 3% -5% 0 5%;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: radial-gradient(ellipse, #e2ead5 0%, rgba(226, 234, 213, .55) 42%, transparent 72%);\n      filter: blur(12px);\n    }\n\n    .orbit {\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: 0;\n      width: 116px;\n      height: 116px;\n      top: -19px;\n      right: -9px;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(29, 101, 96, .12);\n      border-radius: 50%;\n    }\n\n    .orbit::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 9px;\n      height: 9px;\n      right: 17px;\n      top: 21px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: var(--coral);\n    }\n\n    .app-window {\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 1;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(27, 74, 68, .11);\n      border-radius: 18px;\n      background: var(--white);\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n      transform: rotate(1.1deg);\n    }\n\n    .app-top {\n      height: 52px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 18px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #edf0e9;\n      background: #fffefa;\n    }\n\n    .app-name {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      letter-spacing: -.2px;\n    }\n\n    .mini-logo {\n      width: 20px;\n      height: 20px;\n      display: grid;\n      place-items: center;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      background: var(--teal);\n      color: var(--lime);\n    }\n\n    .mini-logo svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; }\n\n    .app-top-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 13px; }\n\n    .week-label { color: #86928c; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 650; }\n    .app-avatars { display: flex; }\n    .app-avatars .avatar {\n      width: 22px;\n      height: 22px;\n      margin-left: -6px;\n      border-color: white;\n      font-size: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .board {\n      padding: 19px 19px 20px;\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(#e9ece4 0.75px, transparent .75px) 0 0 / 12px 12px,\n        #fbfbf7;\n    }\n\n    .board-heading {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: flex-end;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .board-heading h2 {\n      margin: 0 0 4px;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      letter-spacing: -.65px;\n    }\n\n    .board-heading p { margin: 0; color: #89938d; font-size: 10px; }\n\n    .board-date {\n      padding: 7px 10px;\n      border: 1px solid #e8ebe3;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      background: white;\n      color: #63716b;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    .columns {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n      gap: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .day {\n      min-height: 255px;\n      padding: 10px 8px;\n      border: 1px solid #e9ebe4;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 253, .88);\n    }\n\n    .day-head {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      margin: 0 1px 10px;\n      color: #63716c;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      letter-spacing: .55px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .day-head span:last-child {\n      color: #abb2aa;\n      font-size: 8px;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n    }\n\n    .task {\n      margin-bottom: 7px;\n      padding: 9px 8px;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(34, 72, 63, .06);\n      border-radius: 7px;\n      background: white;\n      box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(43, 63, 52, .035);\n    }\n\n    .task-title {\n      margin-bottom: 7px;\n      color: #344b46;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      line-height: 1.35;\n    }\n\n    .task-meta {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      color: #9aa39a;\n      font-size: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .tag {\n      padding: 3px 5px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      color: #42664f;\n      background: #e6f0de;\n      font-size: 7px;\n      font-weight: 750;\n    }\n\n    .tag.coral { color: #9c5844; background: #f9e6dd; }\n    .tag.lilac { color: #65567e; background: #eee9f7; }\n\n    .task-footer {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      margin-top: 7px;\n    }\n\n    .tiny-person {\n      width: 17px;\n      height: 17px;\n      display: grid;\n      place-items: center;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      color: #36564e;\n      background: #dce9cb;\n      font-size: 7px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n    }\n    .tiny-person.pink { background: #f3d3c8; }\n    .tiny-person.blue { background: #d7e4f2; }\n\n    .add-task {\n      padding: 8px;\n      border: 1px dashed #dce1d7;\n      border-radius: 7px;\n      color: #9ba69d;\n      font-size: 9px;\n    }\n\n    .app-bottom {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 11px 19px;\n      border-top: 1px solid #edf0e9;\n      background: #fffefa;\n    }\n\n    .week-progress {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      color: #72817a;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      font-weight: 650;\n    }\n\n    .progress-track {\n      width: 66px;\n      height: 5px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      background: #ebeee6;\n    }\n\n    .progress-track span {\n      display: block;\n      width: 68%;\n      height: 100%;\n      border-radius: inherit;\n      background: #8cb977;\n    }\n\n    .done-pill {\n      padding: 6px 9px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: #edf3e8;\n      color: #52764e;\n      font-size: 8px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n    }\n\n    .floating-note {\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: 2;\n      right: -26px;\n      bottom: 39px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n      padding: 12px 15px;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(27, 74, 68, .08);\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      background: #fffefa;\n      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(22, 57, 53, .12);\n      transform: rotate(-2deg);\n    }\n\n    .note-icon {\n      width: 31px;\n      height: 31px;\n      display: grid;\n      place-items: center;\n      border-radius: 9px;\n      background: #e5f0d8;\n      color: #527a4d;\n      font-size: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .floating-note strong { display: block; font-size: 10px; }\n    .floating-note small { display: block; margin-top: 3px; color: #84918a; font-size: 9px; }\n\n    .trust {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      gap: 35px;\n      padding: 23px 0 28px;\n      border-top: 1px solid #e5e6dc;\n      color: #8a9690;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      letter-spacing: 1.25px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .trust-label { color: #a1aaa2; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 1.4px; }\n    .trust-name { color: #72827b; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: -.3px; text-transform: none; }\n    .trust-name:nth-last-child(1) { font-family: ui-sans-serif, sans-serif; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.6px; }\n\n    .section {\n      padding: 96px 0 100px;\n      background: #fffefa;\n    }\n\n    .section-head {\n      max-width: 620px;\n      margin: 0 auto 48px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .section-kicker {\n      margin-bottom: 13px;\n      color: var(--teal);\n      font-size: 10px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .section h2 {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n      font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 49px);\n      font-weight: 500;\n      letter-spacing: -1.8px;\n      line-height: 1.08;\n    }\n\n    .section-head p {\n      max-width: 475px;\n      margin: 16px auto 0;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: 15px;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n    }\n\n    .feature-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n      gap: 17px;\n    }\n\n    .feature-card {\n      min-height: 217px;\n      padding: 25px 25px 23px;\n      border: 1px solid #e9ebe2;\n      border-radius: 15px;\n      background: #fbfbf7;\n    }\n\n    .feature-icon {\n      width: 39px;\n      height: 39px;\n      display: grid;\n      place-items: center;\n      margin-bottom: 25px;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      color: #315e51;\n      background: #e5efd8;\n      font-size: 17px;\n    }\n\n    .feature-card:nth-child(2) .feature-icon { background: #f8e7dd; color: #a7684d; }\n    .feature-card:nth-child(3) .feature-icon { background: #e8e4f2; color: #695b84; }\n\n    .feature-card h3 { margin: 0 0 9px; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: -.35px; }\n    .feature-card p { margin: 0; color: #75827b; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; }\n\n    .cta-section { padding: 0 0 78px; background: #fffefa; }\n\n    .cta-box {\n      position: relative;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 30px;\n      padding: 46px 54px;\n      border-radius: 18px;\n      background: #dfeee2;\n    }\n\n    .cta-box::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 310px;\n      height: 310px;\n      top: -185px;\n      right: 145px;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(29, 101, 96, .12);\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 28px rgba(29, 101, 96, .035), 0 0 0 58px rgba(29, 101, 96, .025);\n    }\n\n    .cta-copy { position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n    .cta-copy h2 {\n      max-width: 470px;\n      margin: 0;\n      font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n      font-size: 39px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      letter-spacing: -1.5px;\n      line-height: 1.1;\n    }\n    .cta-copy p { margin: 12px 0 0; color: #57736a; font-size: 14px; }\n    .cta-box .button { position: relative; z-index: 1; flex: 0 0 auto; background: #173f3c; }\n\n    footer {\n      padding: 26px 0 31px;\n      background: #fffefa;\n    }\n\n    .footer-inner {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding-top: 22px;\n      border-top: 1px solid #e9ebe2;\n    }\n\n    .footer-brand { font-size: 16px; }\n    .footer-brand .brand-mark { width: 27px; height: 27px; border-radius: 9px; }\n    .footer-brand .brand-mark svg { width: 17px; height: 17px; }\n\n    .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 24px; color: #7b8881; font-size: 12px; }\n    .copyright { color: #9ba49e; font-size: 11px; }\n\n    @media (max-width: 850px) {\n      .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 30px; padding-top: 45px; }\n      .hero-copy { max-width: 620px; }\n      .hero-art { width: min(680px, 100%); margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 0; }\n      .app-window { transform: none; }\n      .floating-note { right: -8px; }\n      .trust { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 18px 28px; }\n      .trust-label { flex-basis: 100%; text-align: center; }\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 600px) {\n      .wrap { width: min(100% - 34px, 500px); }\n      .nav { height: 70px; }\n      .nav-links { display: none; }\n      .nav-cta { padding: 10px 13px; font-size: 12px; }\n      .hero { padding: 43px 0 57px; }\n      h1 { font-size: clamp(48px, 13vw, 65px); letter-spacing: -2.8px; }\n      .hero-copy > p { font-size: 15px; }\n      .hero-actions { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; }\n      .hero-art { padding: 8px 0 38px; }\n      .app-top { padding: 0 12px; }\n      .week-label { display: none; }\n      .board { padding: 14px 10px; }\n      .columns { gap: 6px; }\n      .day { min-height: 225px; padding: 8px 5px; }\n      .task { padding: 7px 6px; }\n      .task-title { font-size: 8px; }\n      .board-heading h2 { font-size: 15px; }\n      .board-date { font-size: 8px; }\n      .app-bottom { padding: 10px 12px; }\n      .floating-note { right: 0; bottom: 0; padding: 9px 12px; }\n      .trust { gap: 16px 22px; padding: 22px 0; }\n      .trust-name { font-size: 12px; }\n      .section { padding: 72px 0; }\n      .section-head { margin-bottom: 32px; }\n      .section h2 { font-size: 38px; }\n      .feature-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 11px; }\n      .feature-card { min-height: 0; padding: 22px; }\n      .feature-icon { margin-bottom: 18px; }\n      .cta-section { padding-bottom: 54px; }\n      .cta-box { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; padding: 32px 25px; }\n      .cta-copy h2 { font-size: 34px; }\n      .footer-inner { align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 18px; }\n      .footer-links { order: 3; width: 100%; gap: 18px; }\n      .copyright { margin-left: auto; padding-top: 7px; }\n    }\n\n    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n      html { scroll-behavior: auto; }\n      *, *::before, *::after { transition-duration: .01ms !important; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header class=\"wrap\">\n    <nav class=\"nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\">\n      <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Tidepool home\">\n        <span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n            <path d=\"M3 9.5c3 0 3-2.5 6-2.5s3 2.5 6 2.5 3-2.5 6-2.5M3 15c3 0 3-2.5 6-2.5s3 2.5 6 2.5 3-2.5 6-2.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </span>\n        tidepool\n      </a>\n\n      <div class=\"nav-links\">\n        <a href=\"#how-it-works\">How it works</a>\n        <a href=\"#why-tidepool\">Why Tidepool</a>\n        <a href=\"#stories\">Our people</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <a class=\"nav-cta\" href=\"#get-started\">\n        Get started <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2197</span>\n      </a>\n    </nav>\n\n    <main>\n      <section class=\"hero\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\">\n        <div class=\"hero-copy\">\n          <div class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\"></span> A calmer way to plan together</div>\n          <h1 id=\"hero-title\">Make room for a <em>good week.</em></h1>\n          <p>\n            Tidepool brings your team's plans, priorities, and people into one clear place.\n            Less chasing. More making things happen.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n            <a class=\"button\" href=\"#get-started\">\n              Plan your week <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2192</span>\n            </a>\n            <div class=\"micro-proof\">\n              <div class=\"avatars\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                <span class=\"avatar\">AM</span>\n                <span class=\"avatar\">JL</span>\n                <span class=\"avatar\">SK</span>\n                <span class=\"avatar\">+</span>\n              </div>\n              <span>For teams that do good work</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"hero-art\" aria-label=\"Preview of a team's weekly planning board\">\n          <div class=\"art-glow\"></div>\n          <div class=\"orbit\"></div>\n          <div class=\"app-window\">\n            <div class=\"app-top\">\n              <div class=\"app-name\">\n                <span class=\"mini-logo\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n                    <path d=\"M3 9.5c3 0 3-2.5 6-2.5s3 2.5 6 2.5 3-2.5 6-2.5M3 15c3 0 3-2.5 6-2.5s3 2.5 6 2.5 3-2.5 6-2.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n                  </svg>\n                </span>\n                The Goodfolk Studio\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"app-top-right\">\n                <span class=\"week-label\">WEEK OF MAY 20</span>\n                <div class=\"app-avatars\" aria-label=\"Four teammates\">\n                  <span class=\"avatar\">AM</span>\n                  <span class=\"avatar\">JL</span>\n                  <span class=\"avatar\">SK</span>\n                  <span class=\"avatar\">RB</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"board\">\n              <div class=\"board-heading\">\n                <div>\n                  <h2>Our week, together</h2>\n                  <p>A little focus goes a long way.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"board-date\">May 20 \u2013 24\u2304</div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"columns\">\n                <div class=\"day\">\n                  <div class=\"day-head\"><span>Monday</span><span>20</span></div>\n                  <div class=\"task\">\n                    <div class=\"task-title\">Weekly team check-in</div>\n                    <div class=\"task-meta\"><span>9:30 am</span><span class=\"tag\">TEAM</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"task-footer\"><span class=\"tiny-person\">AM</span><span>\u25cc 4</span></div>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"task\">\n                    <div class=\"task-title\">Sketch first concepts</div>\n                    <div class=\"task-meta\"><span>Deep work</span><span class=\"tag coral\">DESIGN</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"task-footer\"><span class=\"tiny-person pink\">JL</span><span>\u2197</span></div>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"add-task\">\uff0b Add a plan</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"day\">\n                  <div class=\"day-head\"><span>Tuesday</span><span>21</span></div>\n                  <div class=\"task\">\n                    <div class=\"task-title\">Share moodboard with client</div>\n                    <div class=\"task-meta\"><span>By 2:00 pm</span><span class=\"tag lilac\">CLIENT</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"task-footer\"><span class=\"tiny-person blue\">SK</span><span>\u25cc 2</span></div>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"task\">\n                    <div class=\"task-title\">Walk + coffee \u2600</div>\n                    <div class=\"task-meta\"><span>12:30 pm</span><span class=\"tag\">LUNCH</span></div>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"add-task\">\uff0b Add a plan</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"day\">\n                  <div class=\"day-head\"><span>Wednesday</span><span>22</span></div>\n                  <div class=\"task\">\n                    <div class=\"task-title\">Build the thing, together</div>\n                    <div class=\"task-meta\"><span>Focus time</span><span class=\"tag coral\">PROJECT</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"task-footer\"><span class=\"tiny-person\">AM</span><span class=\"tiny-person pink\">JL</span></div>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"add-task\">\uff0b Add a plan</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"app-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"week-progress\">\n                <span>This week's focus</span>\n                <span class=\"progress-track\"><span></span></span>\n                <span>68%</span>\n              </div>\n              <span class=\"done-pill\">Looking good \u2197</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"floating-note\">\n            <span class=\"note-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2733</span>\n            <span><strong>Everyone's in the loop</strong><small>One plan, a lot less pinging.</small></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"trust\" id=\"stories\" aria-label=\"Teams using Tidepool\">\n        <span class=\"trust-label\">Good company, good work</span>\n        <span class=\"trust-name\">little mountain</span>\n        <span class=\"trust-name\">common ground</span>\n        <span class=\"trust-name\">\u2197 fieldwork</span>\n        <span class=\"trust-name\">brightside co.</span>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"how-it-works\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\">\n        <div class=\"section-kicker\">A little more in sync</div>\n        <h2>Good weeks don\u2019t happen by accident.</h2>\n        <p>Make the plan together, keep the important things visible, and give everyone more room to do their best work.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"feature-grid\" id=\"why-tidepool\">\n        <article class=\"feature-card\">\n          <div class=\"feature-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2197</div>\n          <h3>Get on the same page</h3>\n          <p>Bring everyone's priorities into one shared weekly view\u2014so the whole team knows what matters.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"feature-card\">\n          <div class=\"feature-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2733</div>\n          <h3>Make space for focus</h3>\n          <p>See the busy bits and the breathing room, then build a week that feels possible for real people.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"feature-card\">\n          <div class=\"feature-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2661</div>\n          <h3>Keep the human in it</h3>\n          <p>Check in, celebrate little wins, and make planning feel like a team ritual\u2014not another chore.</p>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"cta-section\" id=\"get-started\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"cta-box\">\n        <div class=\"cta-copy\">\n          <h2>Start your next week on a better note.</h2>\n          <p>Bring your people. We\u2019ll bring the calm.</p>\n        </div>\n        <a class=\"button\" href=\"mailto:hello@tidepool.team\">\n          Try Tidepool free <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2192</span>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer>\n    <div class=\"wrap footer-inner\">\n      <a class=\"brand footer-brand\" href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Tidepool home\">\n        <span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n            <path d=\"M3 9.5c3 0 3-2.5 6-2.5s3 2.5 6 2.5 3-2.5 6-2.5M3 15c3 0 3-2.5 6-2.5s3 2.5 6 2.5 3-2.5 6-2.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </span>\n        tidepool\n      </a>\n      <div class=\"footer-links\">\n        <a href=\"#how-it-works\">About</a>\n        <a href=\"mailto:hello@tidepool.team\">Contact</a>\n        <a href=\"#get-started\">Get started</a>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"copyright\">\u00a9 2024 Tidepool</span>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}